1238
00:54:13,496 --> 00:54:15,984
As the founder of the Blue Planet Foundation

1239
00:54:15,984 --> 00:54:19,400
and Blue Planet Energy, Henk has been at the forefront

1240
00:54:19,400 --> 00:54:21,371
of renewable energy, innovation,

1241
00:54:21,371 --> 00:54:24,353
and climate policy for over two decades.

1242
00:54:24,353 --> 00:54:27,510
His groundbreaking work began with successfully lobbying

1243
00:54:27,510 --> 00:54:29,970
for Hawaii's historic mandate,

1244
00:54:29,970 --> 00:54:33,840
requiring a 100% renewable energy by 2045,

1245
00:54:33,840 --> 00:54:36,698
the first such commitment in the United States.

1246
00:54:36,698 --> 00:54:39,840
Henk's unique background combines pioneering

1247
00:54:39,840 --> 00:54:41,489
experience and technology.

1248
00:54:41,489 --> 00:54:43,200
He's perhaps best known

1249
00:54:43,200 --> 00:54:46,734
for securing the worldwide rights to Tetris

1250
00:54:46,734 --> 00:54:50,153
and creating Japan's first major role playing video game.

1251
00:54:50,153 --> 00:54:52,780
With deep expertise in climate solutions

1252
00:54:52,780 --> 00:54:55,327
and energy storage systems,

1253
00:54:55,327 --> 00:54:59,100
his proven track record includes inspiring 15 other states

1254
00:54:59,100 --> 00:55:00,150
and two territories

1255
00:55:00,150 --> 00:55:02,944
to adopt similar renewable energy mandates

1256
00:55:02,944 --> 00:55:06,510
and founding the Blue Planet Alliance

1257
00:55:06,510 --> 00:55:10,897
in 2021 to export the successful model globally

1258
00:55:10,897 --> 00:55:13,233
to islands and countries worldwide.

1259
00:55:14,280 --> 00:55:17,339
His ambitious 2045 timeline was deliberately chosen

1260
00:55:17,339 --> 00:55:19,739
to coincide with the 100th anniversary

1261
00:55:19,739 --> 00:55:23,497
of the United Nations, making it a global milestone

1262
00:55:23,497 --> 00:55:25,980
for solving the climate crisis.

1263
00:55:25,980 --> 00:55:29,077
Today, Henk will share his bold vision, titled,

1264
00:55:29,077 --> 00:55:32,192
"We Will Fix Everything by 2045,"

1265
00:55:32,192 --> 00:55:36,675
a roadmap for how strategic policy change, renewable energy,

1266
00:55:36,675 --> 00:55:40,620
innovation, and global collaboration can accelerate our path

1267
00:55:40,620 --> 00:55:42,660
to sustainable future.

