01:30:43,500 --> 01:30:45,673
It's just a thing that we have to do.

2071
01:30:45,673 --> 01:30:49,620
Now, all we have to do to solve climate change is

2072
01:30:49,620 --> 01:30:51,090
to set that deadline.

2073
01:30:51,090 --> 01:30:53,486
I'd like that deadline to be 2045.

2074
01:30:53,486 --> 01:30:55,560
I mean, it could be any time.

2075
01:30:55,560 --> 01:30:58,058
I'm giving them, the electric companies,

2076
01:30:58,058 --> 01:31:00,303
lots of time to make the change.

2077
01:31:01,285 --> 01:31:02,760
That's still 20 years.

2078
01:31:02,760 --> 01:31:04,320
20 years, are you kidding me?

2079
01:31:04,320 --> 01:31:07,986
This is not World War, maybe it is.

2080
01:31:07,986 --> 01:31:09,097
Maybe it is,

2081
01:31:09,097 --> 01:31:12,240
maybe it is another World War, and we have to survive it.

2082
01:31:12,240 --> 01:31:14,679
But in 20 years, we can definitely do this.

2083
01:31:14,679 --> 01:31:19,679
All we need to do is have a deadline and determination.

2084
01:31:20,303 --> 01:31:22,513
People ask me if I have hope.

2085
01:31:22,513 --> 01:31:24,845
I say, "No, I do not have hope.

2086
01:31:24,845 --> 01:31:28,160
I have determination, because we're gonna do this.

2087
01:31:28,160 --> 01:31:31,682
This is all of us, and you are now part of the team."

2088
01:31:31,682 --> 01:31:34,140
I'm gonna say to you, if you're an old engineer,

2089
01:31:34,140 --> 01:31:35,790
if there are any engineers in here,

2090
01:31:35,790 --> 01:31:36,955
you guys got us into this.

2091
01:31:36,955 --> 01:31:38,337
(audience chuckling)

2092
01:31:38,337 --> 01:31:40,200
You guys gotta get us out.

2093
01:31:40,200 --> 01:31:42,360
We can't just give it to our kids.

2094
01:31:42,360 --> 01:31:43,629
This is the big problem.

2095
01:31:43,629 --> 01:31:46,410
And the quicker we solve the problem,

2096
01:31:46,410 --> 01:31:48,390
the less damage we do.

2097
01:31:48,390 --> 01:31:53,390
So please join me in ending climate change by 2045.

2098
01:31:54,936 --> 01:31:58,923
Name of the organization is the Blue Planet Alliance.

2099
01:31:58,923 --> 01:32:01,500
It means alliance of everybody.

2100
01:32:01,500 --> 01:32:03,153
So here we go.

2101
01:32:04,020 --> 01:32:04,853
